cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below, and also cite the original Building 59 dataset (see references)."
title: "Building 59 Data Transformation Benchmark"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
authors:
  - alias: martic1101
repository-code: "https://github.com/martic1101/BenchmarkBuilding59"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
abstract: >-
  601 by-target data transformation cases built from the LBNL Building 59 dataset and its Brick model.
  From a sample of source data and five rows of the target table, a system must produce a program that
  converts unseen days of the source data into the target table. Includes the prompt builder and evaluator.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - data transformation
  - programming by example
  - knowledge graph
  - Brick schema
  - building data
